Ported parts: the ΔT model and its tables (src/time.rs, src/data/deltat.bin), IAU 2000A
nutation and its coefficient tables (src/frames/nutation*.rs), IAU 2006 precession, frame
bias and sidereal time (src/frames/), light-time, gravitational deflection and aberration
(src/ephemeris/observe.rs).

Ephemeris data: NASA JPL planetary ephemerides (DE440s and others) are public domain
works of the U.S. Government, fetched at build/run time and not distributed here, except
for a one-year DE440s excerpt used by the tests (tests/data/de440s_2000.bsp).

